        "id": 18299,
        "name": "AdamH",
        "username": "AdamH",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/71e660/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-07-31T11:01:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The event \"Sacred Sites Under Threat\" came up in a recent game and we couldn't figure out what is supposed to happen here. I'll copy the relevant part of the text. There's an option we can choose:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><div>Cost: 3 Energy per land where you do damage, aided by fire</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>In each land with a sacred site and invaders:</div><div>Either do 2 damage</div><div>or</div><div>Destroy 1 presence from each spirit</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I guess I'm not sure how to apply the cost here, maybe I'm just not reading the card properly or something? Maybe someone here can explain it using little words for me? We ended up skipping this event and just drawing a new one because we couldn't figure it out. Thanks.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:51:35.843Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 428,
        "reads": 5,
        "readers_count": 4,
        "score": 2141.0,
