      {
        "id": 220852,
        "name": "Dandolo",
        "username": "Dandolo",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dandolo/{size}/1845_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-07-31T11:08:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah the wording on that one threw us off as well. Our interpretation was:</p>\n<p>In each relevant land:</p>\n<p>Either you pay 3 energy , and the spirits there collectively do 2 damage to the invaders.</p>\n<p>Or you pay no energy but destroy 1 presence from each spirit in the land.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:53:24.890Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 22,
        "reads": 4,
        "readers_count": 3,
        "score": 110.8,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 18296,
        "topic_slug": "sacred-sites-under-threat",
        "display_username": "Dandolo",
        "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
        "flair_bg_color": "",
        "flair_color": "",
        "flair_group_id": 41,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
        "can_delete": false,
        "can_recover": false,
        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Yeah the wording on that one threw us off as well. Our interpretation was:\r\n\r\nIn each relevant land:\r\n\r\nEither you pay 3 energy , and the spirits there collectively do 2 damage to the invaders.\r\n\r\nOr you pay no energy but destroy 1 presence from each spirit in the land.",
